Z||000016||2M4 Dale||10-10-2001||08:12 AM||||The reason that particular pic was titled dirty bird is because it was raining and muddy the day I took that pic.....lol......the car was quite dirty !!! Funny thing is....the picture of my car nightflier was taken while sitting "on track" at Mid-Ohio Raceway and it was raining and my car was dirty there too ! Maybe one of these days I'll get a good pic of my ride when it's clean.<P>For an example of price....I originally paid $1,100 for my car.......to date, I have just shy of $6,000 in it. But it has new everything, it is reliable, it gets 35 mpg, and it also has won me a 3rd place trophy in class at the 2000 Fiero Festival plus a 1st place in class at a local car show here in Ohio.<P>I have owned it for 2 1/2 years.<P>Check out the guys at FieroShop....ask for Terry or George.....they should be able to hook you up with a nice, clean, good runnin' Fiero !!! Tell 'em 2M4 Dale sent Ya !<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.net/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroshop.net/</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by 2M4 Dale (edited 10-10-2001).]||||reg||7
